# 🔐 Login Authentication

A simple and responsive "Login Authentication System" built using 'HTML, CSS, and JavaScript'.
The project demonstrates user registration, login authentication, protected dashboard access, username display, and logout functionality using **Browser LocalStorage**.


## 📸 Features

* 📝 User Registration
* 🔐 Login Authentication
* 💾 LocalStorage-based user data management
* 🛡️ Protected Dashboard
* 👤 Display logged-in user's name
* 🚪 Logout functionality
* ❌ Invalid login validation
* 📱 Responsive design
* 🎨 Clean and modern UI
* ⌨️ Form validation using JavaScript

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

| Technology   | Purpose                                   |
| ------------ | ----------------------------------------- |
| HTML5        | Structure of web pages                    |
| CSS3         | Styling and responsive design             |
| JavaScript   | Authentication logic and DOM manipulation |
| LocalStorage | Store user and login information          |

