## ⚠️ Important Security Note

This project is created for **learning and frontend practice**.

Since authentication data is stored in **LocalStorage**, it is **not suitable for production authentication**.

A production authentication system should use:

* Backend authentication
* Password hashing
* Secure HTTP-only cookies or secure token handling
* Database storage
* Server-side validation
* HTTPS


